11550.desc:
Representing new email form
```applescript
    set {_email} to new email using {_account}
    send {_email} to console

    set {_email} to new email using credential string &quot;smtp:gmail.com:587@auth=true&amp;starttls=true&quot; with address &quot;test@gmail.com&quot;
    send {_email} to console

    set {_email} to new email using predefined service OUTLOOK with address &quot;test2@gmail.com&quot;
    send {_email} to console
````

11551.desc:
Representing of Email configuration/account
```applescript
    set {_email} to configured email account &quot;example&quot;
    send address of {_email}
    send type of {_email}
    send host of {_email}
    send port of {_email}
    send auth of {_email}
    send starttls of {_email}
    send service of {_email}
```

13724.desc:
Save the location of a player inside a file with a specified prefix. Limited to files inside the Neon folder in plugins.

Files are always stored inside the Neon folder in plugins. e.g: if you run:
save location of player in &quot;mylocation.yml&quot; with prefix &quot;custom&quot;
the file &quot;mylocation.yml&quot; would be saved in &quot;plugins/Neon/mylocation.yml&quot;
